			Secondary library code.
These are separated components from the main AftGangAglay tree to make their
use inside vendored code easier/more legible in terms of build workflow.

`prof/' (or `apro') is a profiling library which requires intrusive timestamp
functions be inserted into code that is to be measured.

`asys/' is a base system layer for abstracting between various
supported platforms.

